WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:09.757
The Six to Ten of Pentacles cover giving, patience, skill, comfort and
legacy, the steadier and more settled half of the earth suit.

00:00:11.057 --> 00:00:12.087
Six of Pentacles.

00:00:12.087 --> 00:00:14.691
Generosity, giving and receiving,
fairness.

00:00:14.691 --> 00:00:19.172
A well-dressed figure holds scales and
gives coins to two kneeling people.

00:00:20.472 --> 00:00:21.684
Seven of Pentacles.

00:00:21.684 --> 00:00:24.173
Patience, assessment, long-term effort.

00:00:24.173 --> 00:00:28.448
A gardener leans on a hoe and looks at a
bush heavy with pentacles.

00:00:29.748 --> 00:00:30.940
Eight of Pentacles.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.637
Diligence, craftsmanship, learning a
skill.

00:00:33.637 --> 00:00:39.408
A craftsperson sits at a bench, carving pentacles
one by one, with finished ones on display.

00:00:40.808 --> 00:00:43.239
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:43.239 --> 00:00:48.169
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
